      `the party has received and accepted a written mandate from a provider of an AI system or a general-purpose AI model` IS A BOOLEAN @desc Have you received and accepted a written mandate from the provider of the general-purpose AI model?
      `the mandate is to perform and carry out on the provider's behalf the obligations and procedures established by this Regulation` IS A BOOLEAN @desc Is the mandate to perform and carry out on the provider's behalf the obligations and procedures established by the Regulation?
GIVETH A MAYBE BOOLEAN
DECIDE `Under Article 54, as an authorised representative, am I an authorised representative of the provider of a general-purpose AI model` IS
    JUST (`Art 3(5) the party is an authorised representative` `the party is located or established` `the party has received and accepted a written mandate from a provider of an AI system or a general-purpose AI model` `the mandate is to perform and carry out on the provider's behalf the obligations and procedures established by this Regulation`)

